  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for pilot project, &#x201C;Promotion of Agricultural Crop Production Systems which Demonstrate Resilience to Climate and Weather&#x201D; which will be implemented by the CARICOM Secretariat together with the Caribbean Agricultural Research and Development Institute (CARDI). 
The project responds to the vulnerability of small island nation and the need to enhance their climate resilience with a focus on the promotion of agricultural crop production systems.</narrative>
